      "resolved": true,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 813503753,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Another (simpler) solution could be:\n\n1. add a `DISSECTOR_ASSERT` in `tvb_bytes_to_str_punct`. This will notify the user/developer that something needs to be fixed in the dissector. Indeed the function `tvb_bytes_to_str` already has such a check.\n1. fix the dissectors so this error won't show.\n\nHow does it sound?",
          "author": {
            "id": 277876,
            "username": "crondaemon",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Dario Lombardo",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
