      "title": "tvbuff: assert the called len is > 0.",
      "message": "tvbuff: assert the called len is > 0.\n\nThis assert will notify the higher layers that the dissector needs\nto be fixed. ieee1722 and zbee-zcl dissectors have been updated to\nprevent such a call.\n\nRef: #17882.\n",
      "author_name": "Dario Lombardo",
      "author_email": "lomato@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2022-01-18T11:43:08.000+01:00",
